<p><br> Sayyada (4)<br> Ya taahera raazia marzia fatema shaafiya qairunnisa umm e abeeha sayyada</p> 
<p>Assalam (8)<br> Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)<br> Alwida alwida sayyada alwida (2)</p> 
<p>1) Jo bhi ansaar e Husain ibn e ALI qatl huwa<br> Girkey ghodey se zamee par Wo yehi kehta tha<br> Anta ummi Wa abii mamba fidaa e maula (2)</p> 
<p>Kehrahey they yahi maqtool e jafaa</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)<br> Alwida alwida sayyada alwida (2)</p> 
<p>2) hurr chalaa jaanib e maqtal paye nusrat jis damm<br> Yu lagaa uth'tey ho jannat ki taraf uskey qadam<br> Jung kartey huwey jab narga e aadaa mey ghiraa (2)</p> 
<p>Zaqm khaata raha aur kehta raha</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)</p> 
<p>Haaye aoun o Mohammad maaregaye (2)<br> Dono they aapke mehlaqa sayyada</p> 
<p>3) rann mey jab aoun o Mohammad ki sawaari aayi<br> Zulm ki kaali ghataa unki saro par chaayi<br> Qush huwey dono shahaadat ki qabar hai laayii (2)</p> 
<p>Dii sadaa dono ney ye qabl e qazaa</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)</p> 
<p>Haaye ugli jawaani Akbar dii (2)<br> Jedi maqnad hoyi e tabaa sayyada</p> 
<p>4) shaah ka noor e nazar laqt e jigar aks e nabii<br> Ladkey maidaan mey Akbar ney sinaa jab khaayii<br> Aagaya moo ko jigar qalb mey tootii barchii (2)</p> 
<p>Chup zabaa hogayi laasha bola</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)<br> Alwida alwida sayyada alwida (2)</p> 
<p>5) hokey bey baazu alamdaar e jarii kehta tha<br> Aarahii hai mujhey qushboo e janaab e zehra<br> Mauta mohlat mujhey dedey paye rabb e Kaaba (2)</p> 
<p>Aaqri jumla ye Karney dey adaa</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)<br> Alwida alwida sayyada alwida (2)</p> 
<p>6) daf'atan jhooley se ek nanha mujaahid nikla<br> Qadd mey chota tha jigar hazrat e Abbas ka tha<br> Misl e Abbas Wo maidaan mey bey teyg ladaa (2)</p> 
<p>Muskuraatey huwey asgar ney Kahaa</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)</p> 
<p>Chakki peeskey zehra ney paala jisey (2)<br> Wo to pyaasa jahaa se gayaa sayyada</p> 
<p>7) aaqri sajda e aaqir ki ghadi aa pahunchi<br> Zeen se aaye zamee par Jo Husain ibn e ali<br> Shimr e mal'oon ney gardan pey Jo shamsheer rakhi (2)</p> 
<p>Girkey maula ka lahoo bol utha</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)<br> Alwida alwida sayyada alwida (2)</p> 
<p>8) kyu na rehan o raza nazr karey hum ye kalaam<br> Waaris e majlis e Shabbir Jo hai uskey naam<br> Taakey qush humse ho gaibat mey hamaara Wo imam (2)</p> 
<p>Raat din hai ye wazeefa jiska</p> 
<p>Assalam o alaike ya sayyada (4)<br> Alwida alwdia sayyada alwida (2)</p> 
<p>Assalam (6)</p>